        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Acorn RL9BP, 6-5/8\" Black Iron Shutter and Gate Bolt</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis old world style slide bolt latch can be used on light doors, inside or outside, shutters, or cabinet doors. It is also perfect for gardens and atriums. The 6-5/8 inch slide bolt has a rough iron finish that mimics the texture of naturally weathered iron. It has a lifetime no rust warranty.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Iron Slide Bolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Rough Black Iron</b></li>\r\n<li>Bolt Length: 6-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Back Plate Length: 6-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Back Plate Width: 1-11/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Surface Strike Length: 3-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Surface Strike Width: 1-11/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Gauge: .120</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<b>Lifetime No-Rust Warranty!</b>\r\n</p>",
